OL,3,GNEWSAFood banks facing 'critically low'
OL,4,Adonation levels
OL,5,
OL,6,FFood banks in Yorkshire and northern
OL,7,FLincolnshire are facing critically low
OL,8,Fdonation levels, according to
OL,9,Fanti-poverty charity Trussell.
OL,11,FSurvey data from the charity found four
OL,12,Fin 10 of the area's food banks were
OL,13,Fstruggling for donations as they
OL,14,Fprepared for winter.
OL,16,FAlmost half of the area's 168 food
OL,17,Fbanks surveyed said the situation was
OL,18,Fworse than in previous years, with
OL,19,Ffalling donations, rising operating
OL,20,Fcosts and higher demand.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
