OL,3,GNEWSAFood banks facing 'critically low'
OL,4,Adonation levels
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity said some people were
OL,7,Falready living on a knife edge, where a
OL,8,Frent increase, broken appliance or
OL,9,Funexpected bill could be enough to push
OL,10,Ffamilies into crisis.
